      ":question/id": "5878ac8c-1018-53c1-8c54-8a12124498ff",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x,y)=3{x}^{2}y,$ then $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "ec1504a3-772d-5ff6-8d74-0930f62f5bfc",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "cace3cd2-6aac-5a6d-97c7-d02c9584336e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{3{x}^{2}(y+h)+3{x}^{2}y}{h})"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "cd89e6b5-f350-5857-bcd5-11a2d804b896",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{3{x}^{2}y-3{x}^{2}(y+h)}{h})"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "fe62edfb-c8de-5e08-8c40-5887bc45118d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{3(x+h)^{2}y-3{x}^{2}y}{h})"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "17b0c2b5-fec4-550e-a4b4-d9addf4fb092",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{3{x}^{2}(y+h)-3{x}^{2}y}{h})"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "8c8bd88b-7969-5cdc-b91c-9eb57c3c8152",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{3(x+h)^{2}y+3{x}^{2}y}{h})"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "fe62edfb-c8de-5e08-8c40-5887bc45118d"
          ]
        }
      ],
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{f(x+h,y)-f(x,y)}{h}).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=3{x}^{2}y$,  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x+h,y)=3(x+h)^{2}y.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{3(x+h)^{2}y-3{x}^{2}y}{h}).\n$$"
    },
